cord runs 75 years, 1951 to 2025, and on the middle value of the county&rsquo;s 6 grids March to April and October to November each came in under 90% of normal in 36 of them. In 2025 the middle of the grids got 17% of normal in January to February and 197% in June to July. So far in 2026, June to July sits at 56% on the middle of the grids. Grid 27439 had its driest year in 1958 at 45%.</p>"}
